{"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Semirings\/documentation\/Semirings\/Semiring","doc:\/\/Semirings\/SL","doc:\/\/Semirings\/SQ"],"type":"inheritsFrom","kind":"relationships","title":"Inherits From"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Semirings\/documentation\/Semirings\/BooleanSemiring","doc:\/\/Semirings\/documentation\/Semirings\/BottleneckSemiring","doc:\/\/Semirings\/documentation\/Semirings\/TropicalSemiring"],"type":"conformingTypes","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforming Types"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SelectiveSemiring"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Semirings\/documentation\/Semirings\/Semiring","text":"Semiring","preciseIdentifier":"s:9Semirings8SemiringP"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Comparable","preciseIdentifier":"s:SL"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"So "},{"code":"a ⊕ b","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is the better of the two, "},{"code":"<","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is a strict total order, and "},{"code":"zero","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is the worst"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"element. "},{"code":"<","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is not the order of the raw values: "},{"code":"BottleneckSemiring(9) < BottleneckSemiring(2)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(wider is better) and "},{"code":"BooleanSemiring(true) < BooleanSemiring(false)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Dijkstra’s algorithm, Bellman–Ford, DAG shortest paths and Floyd–Warshall in ShortestPaths take","type"